    },
    {
      "id": "u_fd5f9ce3f6673be5a7931e9f_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "As the document is scrolled, the heading being read is highlighted and the list scrolls to keep it in view. If that heading is hidden inside a collapsed section, the collapsed heading is highlighted instead.",
      "sourceHash": "fd5f9ce3f6673be5a7931e9f4268e7860cdc88464f8fafc2e0d4c12fa9da7612",
      "context": "Outline tab > Table of contents > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "c62a562aae1de49caf864fafb790e97091a6c18fe68c32dfaf26400e911f6d42",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_45cefcc1c30f3737d241724e_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Nested items can be collapsed by pressing the corresponding __TRILIUM_PH_0__ button.",
      "sourceHash": "45cefcc1c30f3737d241724e338c9d01c44de43478eee4e3c93b07b1f2ff1696",
