      "id": "u_32b640d227c6c9fd254a633e_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Unlike table of contents which supports multiple note types, the highlights are specific to the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Text__TRILIUM_PH_1__ notes.",
