      "kind": "p",
      "source": "When __TRILIUM_PH_0__PDFs__TRILIUM_PH_1__ are opened in Trilium, the __TRILIUM_PH_2__Right Sidebar__TRILIUM_PH_3__ is augmented with PDF-specific navigation, with the following features:",
